---
layout: base.njk
title: "Advertise on SkillMaxx: reach developers using coding agents"
desc: "Sponsor the SkillMaxx newsletter or a featured slot in the directory of agent skills, plugins and MCP servers for Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi."
---
<div class="wrap"><h1 class="ph">Advertise</h1><p class="lead">Put your skill, plugin or MCP server in front of developers choosing what to install, across 5 agents. We're brand new with no traffic numbers yet, so we won't make any up.</p>
<style>.mk{margin:10px 0;padding-left:18px;line-height:1.9}.mk b{color:var(--a)}.fbadge{display:inline-block;margin:4px 0 14px;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(198,244,50,.12);border:1px solid rgba(198,244,50,.4);color:var(--a);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;max-width:100%}@media (min-width:961px){.tiers{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}.tier .book{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:auto}.tier{cursor:pointer}.price .was{color:var(--m);font-size:.6em;font-weight:500;margin-right:6px;text-decoration-thickness:2px}</style>
<p class="fbadge">Founding price, locked for 6 months · first 10 sponsors</p>
<div class="tiers">{% for t in sponsorLinks.slots %}<div class="card static tier{% if t.highlight %} hl2{% endif %}" id="slot-{{ t.key }}"><h2 class="h3">{{ t.name }}</h2><p class="price">${{ t.price }}<small> {{ t.priceSuffix }}</small></p><p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:0 0 6px">Founding price, locked for 6 months</p><p class="muted">{{ t.desc }}</p>{% if t.url %}<a class="btn book" href="{{ t.url }}" rel="noopener" data-slot="{{ t.key }}">{{ t.bookLabel }}</a>{% if t.subUrl %}<a class="btn book sub" href="{{ t.subUrl }}" rel="noopener" data-slot="{{ t.key }}-monthly" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t.subBookLabel }}</a>{% endif %}{% else %}<a class="btn book" href="#inquiry-form" data-slot="{{ t.key }}" aria-label="Book {{ t.name }}: open the inquiry form">Book now</a>{% endif %}</div>
{% endfor %}</div>
{% if sponsorLinks.compareNote %}<p class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:12px;max-width:52rem">{{ sponsorLinks.compareNote }}</p>{% endif %}
<p class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:8px">Subscriptions renew monthly and you can cancel anytime — {% if sponsorLinks.portalUrl %}<a href="{{ sponsorLinks.portalUrl }}" rel="noopener">Manage or cancel your subscription</a> (or email <a href="mailto:skillmaxx@gilventures.ai?subject=Cancel%20sponsorship">skillmaxx@gilventures.ai</a>){% else %}just email <a href="mailto:skillmaxx@gilventures.ai?subject=Cancel%20sponsorship">skillmaxx@gilventures.ai</a> and we cancel before the next charge{% endif %}. No contracts.</p>
<p class="muted">These are founding prices for the first 10 sponsors, locked for 6 months. No higher “regular” price is shown — what you see is what you pay.</p>

<section class="card static" id="what-you-get" style="margin:20px 0 8px">
  <h2 class="h3">What you get</h2>
  <p class="muted">Draft for Brandon's review — mockups use a labeled <b>Example</b> sponsor, not a real customer. No invented traffic numbers.</p>

  <h3 class="h3" style="font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:18px">1. Newsletter sponsor</h3>
  <p class="muted">Where: one labeled block in SkillMaxx Weekly (email + the public archive page after send). Includes: up to ~50 words, one link, “Sponsor” label. Duration: one issue ($19) or all ~4 issues that month ($59/mo). Audience: subscriber count is shared privately and in your monthly report once we have real numbers — we do not invent them here.</p>
  <p><img src="/assets/social/placements/newsletter-sponsor-example.png" alt="Example newsletter sponsor block labeled EXAMPLE" width="560" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--b2)"></p>

  <h3 class="h3" style="font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:18px">2. Featured slot (homepage)</h3>
  <p class="muted">Where: the Sponsored card in the homepage Featured row (one per row). Includes: name, one-line pitch (max 90 characters), logo (square SVG/PNG, 256px+), link, always marked Sponsored. Duration: one calendar month; this slot rotates monthly and is not sold with a long rate lock. Price for newcomers can rise as the audience grows.</p>
  <p><img src="/assets/social/placements/featured-card-example.png" alt="Example homepage Featured Sponsored card labeled EXAMPLE" width="720" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--b2)"></p>

  <h3 class="h3" style="font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:18px">3. Category sponsor</h3>
  <p class="muted">Where: logo + link on one category browse page (e.g. Database). One sponsor per category. Duration: one month, or founding lock of 6 months (12 months if booked in the BFCM window once that offer is approved). No traffic claims until analytics are live.</p>
  <p><img src="/assets/social/placements/category-slot-example.png" alt="Example category page sponsor strip labeled EXAMPLE" width="720" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--b2)"></p>

  <h3 class="h3" style="font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:18px">4. Premium / custom partnership</h3>
  <p class="muted">Need something outside these slots (multi-category, custom placement, longer partnership)? Email <a href="mailto:skillmaxx@gilventures.ai?subject=Premium%20partnership">skillmaxx@gilventures.ai</a> — we will not invent packages here. Money never changes a test result or ranking; every paid placement stays labeled.</p>
</section>

<div class="why"><div><h2>High-intent readers</h2><p>Visitors arrive searching for a specific capability and leave with an install command. That's the moment they pick a tool.</p></div><div><h2>Every agent at once</h2><p>One listing reaches Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi users, not a single ecosystem.</p></div><div><h2>Labeled, never blended</h2><p>Sponsored cards are marked "Sponsored" and never alter compatibility statuses or sort order.</p></div></div>
<p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:10px">Paid placements never change a status or a ranking.</p>


<section class="card static" id="media-kit" style="margin-top:28px"><h2 class="h3">Media kit: the real numbers</h2>
<p class="muted">Updated automatically every time the site builds. We only publish numbers we can prove.</p>
<ul class="mk">
<li><b>{{ skills.length }}</b> skills, plugins and MCP servers listed</li>
<li><b>5</b> agents covered: Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor, Pi</li>
{% if testing.total %}<li><b>{{ testing.total }}</b> sandboxed install tests in the latest run, <b>{{ testing.pass }}</b> passing ({{ testing.runAt | truncate(10, true, "") }})</li>{% endif %}
<li>Test results refreshed nightly; failures are published, not hidden</li>
<li>Newsletter: {% if sponsorLinks.subscribers %}<b>{{ sponsorLinks.subscribers }}</b> subscribers{% else %}just launched; subscriber count shared privately and in your monthly report{% endif %}</li>
<li>Site traffic: analytics are being set up, so no traffic numbers yet</li>
</ul>
{% if weeks.length %}{% set w = weeks[0] %}<h3>Why developers trust the numbers (week {{ w.key }})</h3>
<p class="muted">Every listed add-on, really installed every night. Failures get a retry, "broken" needs two bad nights, and missing-API-key failures are counted apart. Your sponsorship never touches these results.</p>
{% include "weekchart.njk" %}<p class="muted"><a href="/reports/week/{{ w.key }}/">Full weekly scorecard</a> · <a href="/reports/latest/">Today's install check</a></p>{% endif %}
<p class="muted"><b>Ad specs:</b> newsletter blurb up to 50 words + 1 link; featured card: name, 1-line pitch (max 90 chars), logo (square SVG or PNG, 256px+), link; category sponsor: logo + link. Every placement is labeled "Sponsored". Full specs: email <a href="mailto:skillmaxx@gilventures.ai">skillmaxx@gilventures.ai</a>.</p>
</section>

<div class="card static" style="margin-top:20px" id="inquiry-form">
  <h2 class="h3">Inquire about advertising</h2>
  <p class="muted">Pick a slot (or something custom) and tell us about your tool. Fill out the form below and someone will respond by email — usually within a business day.</p>
  <form id="ad-form" data-smx-form data-err="#ad-error" data-mail="mailto:skillmaxx@gilventures.ai?subject=Sponsor%20inquiry" action="https://formsubmit.co/skillmaxx@gilventures.ai" method="POST" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-top:12px">
    <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/advertise/?sent=true#inquiry-form">
    <input type="hidden" name="_autoresponse" value="Hey, thanks for reaching out about sponsoring SkillMaxx!&#10;&#10;A human (me, Brandon) reads every inquiry and replies within 1 business day. No bots on this side of the inbox, promise.&#10;&#10;While you wait, the sponsor menu and founding prices are here: https://skillmaxx.gilventures.ai/advertise/ . Every slot can be paid once or as a cancel-anytime subscription, checked out securely through Stripe.&#10;&#10;To speed things up, email skillmaxx@gilventures.ai with:&#10;1. Which tool or product you&#x27;d like in front of agent builders&#10;2. A rough budget&#10;3. When you&#x27;d like to start&#10;&#10;Honest bit: we&#x27;re new and small, which is why founding prices are low. And money never changes a test result.&#10;&#10;Brandon&#10;SkillMaxx · https://skillmaxx.gilventures.ai">
    <input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
    <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table">
    <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Advertiser Inquiry - SkillMaxx">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,220px),1fr));gap:10px">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
        <label for="ad-name" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--m)">Name <span style="color:#e55">*</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="ad-name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name" style="background:var(--s2);color:var(--t);border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;min-height:40px">
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
        <label for="ad-email" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--m)">Email <span style="color:#e55">*</span></label>
        <input type="email" id="ad-email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" style="background:var(--s2);color:var(--t);border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;min-height:40px">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
      <label for="ad-company" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--m)">Company</label>
      <input type="text" id="ad-company" name="company" placeholder="Your company or product" style="background:var(--s2);color:var(--t);border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;min-height:40px">
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
      <label for="ad-type" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--m)">Ad type <span style="color:#e55">*</span></label>
      <select id="ad-type" name="ad_type" required style="background:var(--s2);color:var(--t);border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;min-height:40px">
        <option value="">Select one…</option>
        <option value="Custom / other" data-slot="custom">Something custom</option>
        <option value="Newsletter sponsor ($19 for 1 issue founding)" data-slot="newsletter">Newsletter — $19 for 1 issue (founding)</option>
        <option value="Newsletter 4-pack ($59/mo for 4 issues founding)" data-slot="newsletter-monthly">Newsletter 4-pack — $59/mo for 4 issues (~$15 each, save $17)</option>
        <option value="Featured slot ($29 for 1 month founding)" data-slot="featured">Featured — $29 for 1 month (founding)</option>
        <option value="Category sponsor ($15 for 1 month founding)" data-slot="category">Category — $15 for 1 month (founding)</option>
        <option value="Founding bundle ($49 for 1 month, worth $63)" data-slot="bundle">Founding bundle — $49 for 1 month (1 NL issue + Featured + Category, worth $63)</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">
      <label for="ad-message" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--m)">Message <span style="color:#e55">*</span></label>
      <textarea id="ad-message" name="message" required rows="4" placeholder="Tell us about your skill, plugin or MCP server and what you're interested in…" style="background:var(--s2);color:var(--t);border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;resize:vertical;min-height:90px"></textarea>
    </div>
    <button type="submit" class="btn" style="align-self:flex-start;padding:10px 24px;font-weight:600">Send inquiry</button>
  </form>
  <div id="ad-success" role="status" hidden style="margin-top:14px;padding:14px;border-radius:9px;background:rgba(198,244,50,.08);border:1px solid rgba(198,244,50,.3)">
    <p style="margin:0;color:var(--a);font-weight:600">✓ Inquiry sent</p>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0">Thanks! Someone will get back to you by email, usually within a business day.</p>
  </div>
  <p id="ad-error" role="alert" hidden style="margin-top:10px;color:#e55;font-size:13px">Something went wrong. Please try again or email us directly at skillmaxx@gilventures.ai.</p>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  var form = document.getElementById('ad-form');
  var ok = document.getElementById('ad-success');
  var err = document.getElementById('ad-error');
  var sel=document.getElementById('ad-type');
  function pick(k){for(var i=0;i<sel.options.length;i++){if(sel.options[i].dataset.slot===k){sel.selectedIndex=i;break}}}
  document.querySelectorAll('a.book[href="#inquiry-form"]').forEach(function(a){a.addEventListener('click',function(e){e.preventDefault();e.stopPropagation();pick(a.dataset.slot);var f=document.getElementById('inquiry-form');f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});setTimeout(function(){sel.focus({preventScroll:true})},400);history.replaceState(null,'','#inquiry-form')})});
  document.querySelectorAll('.tier').forEach(function(c){c.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(e.target.closest('a'))return;var b=c.querySelector('a.book');if(b)b.click()})});
  var m=location.search.match(/[?&]slot=([a-z]+)/);if(m)pick(m[1]);

  if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('sent') === 'true') { form.hidden = true; ok.hidden = false; history.replaceState(null, '', location.pathname + '#inquiry-form') }
})();
</script>
<script src="/assets/forms.js" defer></script>
</div>
